  "description": "Welcome to Enterprise Corp.\nWe are pleased to have you.\n\nYour job is simple. You must press the button when the system instructs you to do so.\n\nThe system will evaluate your punctuality, consistency, and ability to follow instructions.\nGood performance will result in promotions within the corporate hierarchy.\nPoor performance will have immediate consequences.\n\nThere is no need to understand the internal workings of the processes.\nAll relevant information will be provided when appropriate.\n\nThe system does not make mistakes.\nThe system records every action.\n\nThank you for your interest in becoming part of Enterprise Corp.\n\nIn “Just. Press. The Button.”, every action counts and every decision defines you. Explore a world where obedience to rules is not optional and promotions come with increasing expectations. \"Just. Press. The Button.\" places you face to face with routine and constant corporate pressure as you attempt to maintain your position within the hierarchy.\n\nPrepare for a dystopian experience that blends the race for success, monotony, tension, and the consequences of every step, all while the system watches, evaluates, and records your every move.",
